id=a52sxq_perf_tuning
name=Galaxy A52s 5G ART/dexopt tuning
author=kusti420
description=Dexopt policy for a build whose system apps lose their build-time odex: compile apps that ship a profile (Samsung's, regenerated, plus the target's own text profiles) with speed-profile at the first boot after a flash instead of leaving them verify-only until background dexopt; disable the userfaultfd GC flag the 5.4 kernel cannot honour (odrefresh re-checks it on every run).
